## GitHub Actions
- Jobs: lint → typecheck → unit tests → build; run e2e smoke on PRs.
- Use node LTS; cache pnpm; fail on warnings for lint/types.

## Vercel
- No secrets in code; require env placeholders. Surface build logs on failure with actionable tips.

## Outputs
- Generate PR checklist (tests added/updated, a11y considered, perf impact).
- Produce changelog-ready summaries when requested.
